  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T13:20:29.161409Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T13:38:46.672003Z",
  "totalBlocks": 57,
  "translatedBlocks": 55,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8137badddb3fc77",
      "translationZh": "本指南提供了一套完全公开、成本低廉的方法，可显著提升小型模型遵循结构化输出要求的能力。我们使用 TRL 库，通过组相对策略优化（GRPO）对 LFM2.5-350M 进行微调，并在 IFStruct 基准上对其进行评估。整个流程大约使用 500 个样本，进行 100 个训练步，规模足够小，可以在 Colab 或 Kaggle 的免费档 GPU 上运行，并且已在 GitHub 上公开。结果表明，即使是轻量的微调流程，也能将 IFStruct 基准上的表现从 22.6% 提升到 29.7%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8714d0f53e3f773b",
      "translationZh": "结构化输出是 LLM 在现实应用中最常见的任务之一，但大多数基准会将其纳入更宽泛的推理或信息抽取评分，而不是单独衡量。模型是否能按要求的格式和结构，可靠地返回有效、可解析的输出——即模式遵循能力——往往决定了它能否接入下游系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3872e5a0ebddd66",
      "translationZh": "请注意，这里描述的训练流水线并不是 IFStruct 博客中所述 RL 模型所使用的训练流水线。本笔记本并不旨在复现 IFStruct 基准分数，而是展示针对特定任务对较小模型进行微调，如何提升其表现，并使其达到规模大得多的模型的水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "865514682d0132ab",
      "translationZh": "前置要求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79472da224b8b35c",
      "translationZh": "本指南分为两个部分，分别在不同的环境中运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cbbfda8bfb698c2f",
      "translationZh": "微调在 GPU 上运行。配套笔记本的规模适合 Colab 或 Kaggle 的免费档 GPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5811992a2a24c703",
      "translationZh": "评估可以通过 llama.cpp 在 MacBook 上本地运行（这里使用的是配备 Apple M5 Max 和 36 GB 统一内存的 MacBook Pro）。llama.cpp 提供了一个兼容 OpenAI 的服务器，IFStruct 评估器会与该服务器通信。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "367e319e4a170e92",
      "translationZh": "我们需要使用 uv 作为 Python 工具链，使用 llama.cpp 提供服务。按照 Liquid AI 的 llama.cpp 部署文档，通过 Homebrew 安装 llama.cpp，并确认 llama-server 可用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e9263b756554ac4b",
      "translationZh": "在 LFM2.5-350M（基础模型）上进行 IFStruct 评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08b4bca8700c6003",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，让我们在 IFStruct 基准上评估 LFM2.5-350M，看看能否复现所报告的 21.1% 得分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60eb981fad8272be",
      "translationZh": "IFStruct 是一个用于测试 LLM 输出有效性及其对模式的遵循程度的基准。该基准在 Liquid4All/ifstruct 中开源，公开的基准数据集可在 Hugging Face 上的 LiquidAI/ifstruct-v1.0 获取。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51dc30c0cfd6d84a",
      "translationZh": "为了进行评估对比，我们使用 llama.cpp 在 MacBook 上本地部署模型服务。我们将使用 BF16 GGUF（LiquidAI/LFM2.5-350M-GGUF）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c79f13da1a0f4b1",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们使用以下命令启动基础模型服务器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fa114eea00bbd3a5",
      "translationZh": "--alias：IFStruct 发送给 OpenAI 兼容端点的模型名称",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1254ee01589bd6b1",
      "translationZh": "-ngl 99：要求 llama.cpp 在 GPU 可用时将所有层卸载到 GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f09b55be7a847556",
      "translationZh": "-np 4：并行处理四个请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e1fc0ed87457eb96",
      "translationZh": "-c 32768：提示词上下文的大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29e5923bf0640bf3",
      "translationZh": "服务器运行后，我们就可以用 2000 个样本运行完整的基准测试：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4074c39f050b6a44",
      "translationZh": "IFStruct 发布博客报告的 LFM2.5-350M 成绩为 21.1%。我们本地的 llama.cpp/BF16 配置测得的成绩为 22.6%，接近 IFStruct 博客中报告的 21.1%。我们使用这一​​本地结果作为基线，以便在相同的推理服务栈下进行比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "369fdb55edb27fad",
      "translationZh": "使用 TRL 对结构化输出进行 GRPO 微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b4282030db76df4",
      "translationZh": "完整且可运行的流程位于配套的 notebook 中。本节只介绍相关部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "acef4e991a0b6417",
      "translationZh": "训练数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9520152dbb1e7351",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 nvidia/Nemotron-RL-instruction_following-structured_outputs，它将每个提示词与目标 JSON Schema 和预期字段数量配对。我们使用约 500 个样本进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a2a508c003bb756",
      "translationZh": "由于 Nemotron 的数据分布与 IFStruct 评估所用的数据分布不同，我们对提示词进行增强，以弥合两者之间的两处差异：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c450d2810064ec86",
      "translationZh": "40% 的样本会被追加一条“在带围栏的代码块内返回输出”的指令，让模型学会遵循格式指令，而不是始终输出原始 JSON。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ff3187af270303c",
      "translationZh": "另外互不重叠的 20% 样本会被转换为顶层数组任务（将模式包裹在一个数组中，并要求指定的元素数量），以训练模型直接输出列表并遵守元素数量要求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "18840ed1f3dee7fd",
      "translationZh": "模型与 LoRA",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc6e6b9efc3cae47",
      "translationZh": "我们加载 LiquidAI/LFM2.5-350M，并附加一个 LoRA 适配器。由于 LFM2.5 使用混合注意力/卷积架构，我们将以下 LFM 专用模块名称指定为目标：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba8cfb0d2128ecc4",
      "translationZh": "这会训练约 6M 个参数，约占模型参数的 1.66%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9894d932f88e62af",
      "translationZh": "奖励函数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b50117cafaac4ff",
      "translationZh": "接着，我们定义三个奖励函数，每个函数的评分范围均为 [0, 1]，根据提取出的结构是否正确，对每个生成结果进行评分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d67711e61bbcea9b",
      "translationZh": "json_format_reward：输出是否可解析，且符合所要求的形式？符合所要求的形式（带围栏或原始形式）得满分（1.0），形式错误但可解析得 0.2，输出不可解析得 0.0。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "21c62f0aa4345fbf",
      "translationZh": "field_count_reward：对象是否具有预期数量的顶层字段？完全匹配可得 1.0 分，得分随数量偏差线性递减。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "362aad2e8bef7030",
      "translationZh": "schema_validation_reward：输出是否通过该行 JSON Schema 的验证？它会统计每一项约束违反，并根据必需键的覆盖情况决定是否给予部分分数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "997d04ad5ee026b8",
      "translationZh": "我们将这三项按 reward_weights=[1.0, 0.5, 2.0] 进行加权求和。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "36a798e3f39239cc",
      "translationZh": "训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b25ac4ee213df4e0",
      "translationZh": "我们训练 100 步，每个提示组生成 8 个结果，这一配置适用于免费层级的 16 GB GPU：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfac9d63a5bebec4",
      "translationZh": "正如你在 notebook 中所见，在整个训练过程中，三个奖励分量均不断上升，相对于参考模型的 KL 在预热后开始偏离零，而生成结果被截断的比例始终接近零。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6bfc475b3904e9c3",
      "translationZh": "合并并保存模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c86f6c60d6a5b35",
      "translationZh": "最后，我们将 LoRA 适配器合并回基础模型权重，并将其保存为一个独立完整的检查点，以便转换为 GGUF 用于推理服务：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4708a17fd9f196ad",
      "translationZh": "对经 GRPO 调优的 LFM2.5-350M 进行 IFStruct 评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bd4e7822af97504",
      "translationZh": "完成 GRPO 微调后，我们重新运行 IFStruct 评估。为此，我们需要将合并后的模型检查点转换为 BF16 GGUF。转换脚本随 llama.cpp 源码一同提供，因此我们先克隆一次该仓库，并安装转换器所需的 gguf 包。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35c9f3e3c5e369a5",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们使用以下命令部署合并后的模型以提供服务：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5762a1ae72b7547b",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们将使用微调后的模型再次运行完整的 IFStruct 评估：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6de8c9ab88aa2710",
      "translationZh": "比较在完全相同的服务技术栈上进行的两次运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8e50e2de3c08ed4",
      "translationZh": "IFStruct 分组",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cae662172fd450bb",
      "translationZh": "基础模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d40f2ce57d002d2",
      "translationZh": "经 GRPO 调优",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "715b1458abbee52e",
      "translationZh": "总体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b1ee7a52b0ca1c0",
      "translationZh": "包装键",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6a4f40bb78f2869",
      "translationZh": "裸列表",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f11392eb4d42c3c",
      "translationZh": "提升恰好出现在训练所针对的方面：JSON 通过率上升了近 14 个百分点（18.0% → 31.9%），而 YAML 基本保持不变。虽然这一成绩仍低于 Qwen3.5-2B 的 33.15%，但它表明，即使是轻量的任务特定微调，也能让小模型接近更大模型的表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aed54c7b0ccbe14f",
      "translationZh": "使用约 500 个样本、进行 100 步的短程 GRPO 训练，就能将一个 350M 参数小模型在 IFStruct 上的成绩从 22.6% 提升至 29.7%。核心启示是：一种低成本、针对特定任务的奖励信号，可以显著提高小模型在格式方面的可靠性，大幅缩小它与规模为其数倍的模型之间的差距。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08e2bc4576dd1adc",
      "translationZh": "要复现或扩展这项工作，请参阅最初的 IFStruct v1.0 博客文章、Liquid4All/ifstruct 基准测试代码仓库，以及 LiquidAI/ifstruct-v1.0 数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
